    "head_commit_message": "docs(spec): settle spec 35 step 5: hp's one writer and the fell queue\n\nDecision 145: every hp change goes through UnitHealth, held by a check;\na write that takes a unit to 0 hp or below pushes it onto the store's\nfell queue, which bury drains in today's order and decides died or\ndowned from the final hp, so outcomes and digests stay identical. The\nsame queue pattern serves step 7's downed and living lists. The lane\nskirmish is retired first (5a). Spec 35 gains the step 5 readers list\nand each loop's plan (Decision 144); OPEN_QUESTIONS Q24 is partly\nsettled and Q25 records game-like maps on the real sims.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YWpV2AHWr3d2v4fKRki8G7",
